  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:320px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Concept Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/62/Bolt_Concept_Absorption.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150603063358\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Bolt Concept Absorption\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/62/Bolt_Concept_Absorption.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20150603063358\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/62/Bolt_Concept_Absorption.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20150603063358 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/62/Bolt_Concept_Absorption.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150603063358 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Bolt Concept Absorption\" width=\"270\" height=\"399\" data-image-key=\"Bolt_Concept_Absorption.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Bolt Concept Absorption.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Bolt Crank (Eat-Man) consuming and absorbing one of several concepts.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb concepts.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb concepts and utilize them in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Concept_Manipulation\" title=\"Concept Manipulation\">Concept Manipulation</a>. Advanced application of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConcept_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absolute Assimilation</li>\n<li>Concept Theft</li>\n<li>Conceptual Energy Absorption</li>\n<li>Supreme Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConcept_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb any/all forms of concepts (absolutism, infinity, war, technology, transcendence etc), while removing it from the source, into their body/existence and use it in various ways, gaining complete control and some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently, possibly integrating the concept into themselves allowing them to embody that concept.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConcept_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Meta_Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Meta Power Absorption\">Absolute Superpower Absorption</a> (limited to <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Conceptual_Powers\" title=\"Category:Conceptual Powers\">concept-based powers</a>)\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Meta_Power_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Meta Power Immunity\">Meta Power Immunity</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Conceptual_Anchoring\" title=\"Conceptual Anchoring\">Conceptual Anchoring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Conceptual_Attacks\" title=\"Conceptual Attacks\">Conceptual Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Conceptual_Defense\" title=\"Conceptual Defense\">Conceptual Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Concept_Destruction\" title=\"Concept Destruction\">Concept Destruction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Concept_Embodiment\" title=\"Concept Embodiment\">Concept Embodiment</a> (Varies)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Immutability\" title=\"Immutability\">Immutability</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Non-Physical_Interaction\" title=\"Non-Physical Interaction\">Non-Physical Interaction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Anchoring\" title=\"Reality Anchoring\">Reality Anchoring</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConcept_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Conceptual_Lordship\" title=\"Conceptual Lordship\">Conceptual Lordship</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nigh_Omnipotence\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nigh Omnipotence\">Nigh Omnipotence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Property_Conglomeration\" title=\"Property Conglomeration\">Property Conglomeration</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConcept_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited on conceptual storage capacity.</li>\n<li>May cause paradoxes due to nature of the power.</li>\n<li>May not be able to control this power proficiently.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FConcept_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Shouko Iwagami (<i>Aquarion Logos</i>); via Zero Verbalism</li>\n<li>Thanos (<i>Marvel Comics</i>); via Astral Regulator</li>\n<li>Chainsaw Man/Devil/Pochita (<i>Chainsaw Man</i>)</li>\n<li>Bolt Crank (<i>Eat-Man</i>)</li>\n<li>Chibi-chan (<i>Endro~!</i>)</li>\n<li>Scarlet King and SCP-3125 (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li>Earl Tyrant (<i>Final Fantasy Unlimited</i>)</li>\n<li>Kratos (<i>God of War series</i>)</li>\n<li>Garm (<i>God of War: Ragnarök</i>)</li>\n<li>Nobodies (<i>Kingdom Hearts</i>); as <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ww2iS3d3GRE&amp;t=575s&amp;ab_channel=MarioDragon\">seen here</a></li>\n<li>Gulpo - the fish that eats concepts (<i>Saturday Morning Breakfast Cereal</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://translate.google.com/translate?sl=zh-CN&amp;tl=en&amp;u=http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/gods-beyond-absolute-infinity\">Niddhogg</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3125\">SCP-3125 - The Escapee</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li>The Sevenfold Destroyer/Anafabula/SCP-2747 - As below, so above</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/uiu-file-2014-014\">UIU File 2014-014</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li>The Aeons (<i>Honkai: Star Rail</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit rep